(958, 'Fashion Design : Model Drawing', 'Other', 'Learning to be a Fashion Designer', 'Ava Moradi @udemy', '1. Introduction to Tools and Materials', '1. Intoducition', '<p>In this lesson, students will learn the fundamentals of fashion figure drawing, focusing on body proportions, posture, and gesture to express style and movement. The course introduces basic sketching techniques to illustrate fashion models accurately, emphasizing balance, anatomy, and the flow of fabric on the body. By the end, students will be able to create dynamic model poses and use them as a foundation for developing creative fashion designs.</p><p><br></p><p>Original Files: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy</a></p><p><br></p>', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RG8oM6c88WTxPIKL6smjSFI9y7Sdsmqt/view?usp=drive_link', '0', '2025-10-08 05:58:19', '2025-10-08 05:58:19'),
(959, 'Fashion Design : Model Drawing', 'Other', 'Learning to be a Fashion Designer', 'Ava Moradi @udemy', '2.  Where-fashion-design-begins-complete-model-drawing', '1. Intoducition', '<p>In this lesson, students will learn the fundamentals of fashion figure drawing, focusing on body proportions, posture, and gesture to express style and movement. The course introduces basic sketching techniques to illustrate fashion models accurately, emphasizing balance, anatomy, and the flow of fabric on the body. By the end, students will be able to create dynamic model poses and use them as a foundation for developing creative fashion designs.</p><p><br></p><p>Original Files: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy</a></p><p><br></p>', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GscWG7w4sAKbt7HKpLbDdtNzNgFWOLf1/view?usp=drive_link', '0', '2025-10-08 06:01:04', '2025-10-08 06:01:04'),
(960, 'Fashion Design : Model Drawing', 'Other', 'Learning to be a Fashion Designer', 'Ava Moradi @udemy', '3. Assignment-Introduction-to-Tools-and-Materials', '1. Intoducition', '<p>In this lesson, students will learn the fundamentals of fashion figure drawing, focusing on body proportions, posture, and gesture to express style and movement. The course introduces basic sketching techniques to illustrate fashion models accurately, emphasizing balance, anatomy, and the flow of fabric on the body. By the end, students will be able to create dynamic model poses and use them as a foundation for developing creative fashion designs.</p><p><br></p><p>Original Files: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy</a></p><p><br></p>', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/19d02uID_hlqucMXuwLuXwLfymX0l_xA-/view?usp=drive_link', '0', '2025-10-08 06:01:54', '2025-10-08 06:01:54'),
(961, 'Fashion Design : Model Drawing', 'Other', 'Learning to be a Fashion Designer', 'Ava Moradi @udemy', '1. Female Anatomy Sketching and Drawing', '2. Anatomy', '<p>In this lesson, students will learn the fundamentals of fashion figure drawing, focusing on body proportions, posture, and gesture to express style and movement. The course introduces basic sketching techniques to illustrate fashion models accurately, emphasizing balance, anatomy, and the flow of fabric on the body. By the end, students will be able to create dynamic model poses and use them as a foundation for developing creative fashion designs.</p><p><br></p><p>Original Files: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GypKf3Ytjqcv9WBYwYa9NsFcmOVm_0zy</a></p><p><br></p>', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/19abSIiU98eJPTevYDOMefxatSZq8hkRE/view?usp=drive_link', '0', '2025-10-08 06:04:14', '2025-10-08 06:04:14'),
